      "$$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "$$",
      "\\begin{array}{l} 2 9 8. 1 5 - 7 8 0 \\mathrm{K}: \\quad \\Delta \\mathrm{Hr} ^ {\\circ} = - 2 9. 0 4 2 + 0. 7 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} + 1. 4 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 5. 8 5 0 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} \\\\ \\Delta G r ^ {\\circ} = - 2 9. 0 4 2 - 0. 7 9 8 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{TlnT} - 1. 4 5 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 6} \\mathrm{T} ^ {2} + 2. 9 2 5 \\mathrm{T} ^ {- 1} + 2 5. 3 7 0 \\times 1 0 ^ {- 3} \\mathrm{T} \\\\ \\end{array}",
